Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:54:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Reto 1: cambia el color principal del tema a verde
 azulado
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

AppColors.yellow es el color primary del tema claro y del oscuro. Basta
con un hot reload para verlo en el botón REFRESH y en los puntos de carga.
---
 lib/presentation/shared/design_system/theme/app_colors.dart | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/lib/presentation/shared/design_system/theme/app_colors.dart b/lib/presentation/shared/design_system/theme/app_colors.dart
index b8e8e45..bec402f 100644
--- a/lib/presentation/shared/design_system/theme/app_colors.dart
+++ b/lib/presentation/shared/design_system/theme/app_colors.dart
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ import 'dart:ui';
 abstract class AppColors {
   const AppColors._();
 
-  static const yellow = Color(0xFFFEBE10);
+  static const yellow = Color(0xFF009688);
   static const accent = Color(0xFFFAA21B);
   static const black = Color(0xFF000000);
   static const white = Color(0xFFFFFFFF);
